%% title: Deploy, step 2 of 3: compose, dry-run, sign and move the prod tag
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant R as Rust binary
    participant K as API server
    participant V as Vault Transit
    participant O as ghcr
    S->>O: pull the admitted fragments
    S->>R: compose the estate
    R-->>S: renders, diagnostics
    S->>K: apply, dryRun=All
    alt dry-run accepted
        K-->>S: accepted
        S->>V: sign the render
        S->>O: push the render, move the prod tag
    else dry-run rejected
        K-->>S: rejected
        Note right of S: Project isolated, prod tag unchanged
    end
